  "conformsTo": "http://mlcommons.org/croissant/1.1",
  "name": "vlabench_primitive_ft_lerobot_video",
  "description": "\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tVLABench Primitive Tasks Dataset - LeRobot v3.0\n\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tDataset Description\n\t\n\nThis dataset is organized in the LeRobot v3.0 format and is used for integrating VLABench into the LeRobot framework officially.\nCompared with the v2.0 version and the RLDS version of the dataset, this release stores visual observations in a video-compressed format rather than as individual image files. This design provides significant advantages in both storage efficiency and data loading performance.\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/VLABench/vlabench_primitive_ft_lerobot_video.",
